{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:a9c2387aa74f667b","name":"Replica Droid","source":{"id":"source:reference-a9c2387aa74f667b","title":"Replica Droid","revision":19007,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:07:47Z","sha256":"7baea19e923ef9025ef1bf5dc582f72fa4a742077363d3347ca66bf344ac2547","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19007","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Replica%20Droid&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-a9c2387aa74f667b","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Threats of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Threats_of_the_Galaxy"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Human Replica Droids, or HRDs, are sophisticated synthskin and biofiber-covered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," designed to be nearly indistinguishable from ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"},". Their design was similar enough to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," anatomy that even high-quality medical scanners were not always able to identify them as inorganic, although they were able to discern some differences from the typical ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"},". They were sometimes referred to as \"Meatdroids\" or \"Droid Clones.\" Unlike true clones, a droid clone could be created in under three months.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["These Replica Droids were originally designed by the Alliance to Restore the Republic to infiltrate and replace Imperial personnel, but their funding ultimately ran out, causing them to abandon the project. Ironically enough, The Empire completed and perfected the Replica Droid's design, through they were never put into any major use.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Replica Droid Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Replica Droids are loyal firstly to their creators, though those that become self-aware often attempt to escape that life, setting out on their own in a quest of self-discovery. Self-aware Replica Droids prize freedom and individualism above their own lives, as their creation has given them unique insight into the value of life.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Replica Droids are identical in appearance towards the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," they are replicating (typically ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"},", though there are rare exceptions). While it is possible to alter its appearance in any way they wish, a Replica Droid rarely does so as it removes their ability to blend in. Replica Droids height is based completely on the size of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," they are replicating, and their metal bodies cause them to be double the weight of the replicated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," As inorganic beings, Replica Droids are not affected by the process of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aging"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aging"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," None, though most Replica Droids consider the planet of their creation their homeworld.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," All Replica Droids can understand and speak ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"}," (one of the few ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," that can), and additionally learn the native tongue of their replicated ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," (typically Basic).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Varies, typically dependent on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," being replicated.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," Replica Droids bound to their creators will perform their masters' bidding; and those that escape typically live a live of peace, or go on an adventure of self-discovery. Most Replica Droids fit into the roles of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scouts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scouts"},", although as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," they are incapable of becoming ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi","referenceId":"reference:0b0e48747027a29d"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Replica Droid Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Replica Droids share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Replica Droids receive a +2 bonus to both their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"},", but suffer a -2 penalty to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"},". Replica Droids are built to be physically strong, but have to work to fit in seamlessly with organic beings. Additionally, like other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", Replica Droids have no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Constitution"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Constitution"}," score."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Variable Size:"]}," Since Replica Droids are designed to imitate organic beings, their size depends on the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," they replicate. Replica Droids are typically either Small or Medium sized:\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," When Medium sized, a Replica Droid receives no special modifiers due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Small Size:"]}," When Small sized, a Replica Droid gains a +1 size bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and a +5 size bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks. However, their lifting and carrying limits are three-quarters of those of Medium characters."]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," A Small sized Replica Droid has a base speed of 4 squares. A Medium sized Replica Droid has a base speed of 6 squares. "]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Bonus Equipment:"]}," Replica Droids can be constructed with two of the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Systems"}," installed: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Internal Comlink"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Internal_Comlink","referenceId":"reference:7fadfdfea7aba7e9"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darkvision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darkvision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Diagnostics Package"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Diagnostics_Package","referenceId":"reference:f18faca947488ff4"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improved Sensor Package"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improved_Sensor_Package","referenceId":"reference:63893b69f52fedab"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Compartment Space"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Compartment_Space","referenceId":"reference:ac94b2e9b2d1d3e2"}," (subject to size limitations), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Translator Unit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Translator_Unit","referenceId":"reference:0bcd4b383b11cac0"}," (DC 15)."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Conditional Bonus Feat:"]}," Seeking to perfectly imitate organic creatures, a Replica Droid that has ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained_Skill"}," gains ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Deception)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Deception)"}," as a bonus ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Droid Traits:"]}," Replica Droids operate as if they are ",{"tag":"a","children":["4th-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/4th-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:e0ba1be2d9a6a37a"},", except that they ignore the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Maintenance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Maintenance"}," requirement. Replica Droids have all normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid Traits"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid_Traits"},"."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Replica Droids can speak, read, and write ",{"tag":"a","children":["Binary"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Binary","referenceId":"reference:ee1c8277caf5fb9b"},". All Replica Droids also learn the native language of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," they are replicating (typically Basic for ",{"tag":"a","children":["Humans"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Humans"},")."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
